 chings\, Dhumal deployed an unabashed phallic imagery with an intense mas
 culine charge. It is difficult to identify...\n\nhttps://www.vadehraart.c
 om/exhibitions/318-nocturnes-woodcut-engravings-and-etchings-by-p.d.-d-40
 -defence-colony-new-delhi/overview/
