SUMMARY:IHC Theatre Festival 2026. Home in a Suitcase
LOCATION:The Theatre\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New Delhi 1100
 03
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1412
DESCRIPTION:IHC Theatre Festival 2026 . Home in a Suitcase (English\, Hin
 di/65 mins) Written & Devised by Ramanjit Kaur & Ruhani Singh. Dir. Raman
 jit Kaur . Performed by Ruhani Singh . Home in a Suitcase is an intimate 
 solo performance that explores migration\, memory\, identity\, and the se
 arch for belonging. Set in an unnamed airport\, the play follows Taarini\
 , a young woman navigating the emotional terrain of leaving one home in s
 earch of another. Through evocative storytelling\, movement\, immersive s
 oundscapes\, and audience interaction\, the performance asks a question t
 hat feels increasingly relevant today: Do we ever truly find home\, or do
  we simply carry it with us? Prod. The Creative Arts . Entry by Registrat
 ion. Late entry is strictly prohibited .\n\nhttps://indiahabitat.org/Even
 ts_details/1412
CATEGORIES:performance\,theatre
END:VEVENT
