BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1e967fe5044558a1@delhi-events
DTSTAMP:20260920T105600Z
DTSTART:20260920T133000Z
DTEND:20260920T153000Z
SUMMARY:IHC Theatre Festival 2026. Amb Da Boota
LOCATION:The Stein Auditorium\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New D
 elhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1411
DESCRIPTION:IHC Theatre Festival 2026 . Amb Da Boota (Hindi\, Punjabi\, E
 nglish/ 75 mins) Devised & Performed by Anya Ghai\, Bhavya Rampal\, Jai P
 rakash Kumar\, Pranjal Vaid\, Priyanshu Gupta . Lata\, diagnosed with a t
 erminal illness and nearing death\, expresses a quiet\, unexpected wish- 
 to become a mango tree. While her family struggles to navigate a growing 
 chasm of grief\, anger\, betrayal\, and confusion. Lata embarks on a whim
 sical\, inward journey of her own. The play delicately balances the emoti
 onal weight of death and loss with moments of tenderness and imagination.
  It explores the complexities of relationships\, and the quiet intricacie
 s of loneliness\, asking what it means to seek transformation even at the
  edge of life. Prod. Mantavya Collective . Tickets at Rs.200\, Rs.350\, &
  Rs.500 are available on bookmyshow.com and at the Habitat Programmes des
 k. Late entry is strictly prohibited .\n\nhttps://indiahabitat.org/Events
 _details/1411
CATEGORIES:performance\,theatre
END:VEVENT
