DTSTAMP:20260920T105600Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260923
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260929
SUMMARY:Odyssey
LOCATION:Bikaner House\, Pandara Road\, India Gate\, New Delhi 110011
URL:https://bikanerhouse.rajasthan.gov.in/upcoming-events/2026/9
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Khushi Art his exhibition by Poonam Bhatnagar is
  about mythological characters\, world universes and landscapes as well a
 s an abstract series of geometry and symbolism in contemporary characters
 . Her exhibition of acrylics on canvas as well as drawings on paper creat
 ed in terms of Mythos accents and characters from Indian mythology. Her d
 etails\, her narrative and her compositional brilliance are a set of stor
 ies that transcend both time and tradition. As an artist she has been tra
 cing tradition in the old ideology of mythos and studying landscapes. She
  combines the lexicon of language with the concept of the rustic rhythms 
 of Indian identities in Mythos. This show is curated by Uma Nair.\n\nhttp
 s://bikanerhouse.rajasthan.gov.in/upcoming-events/2026/9
CATEGORIES:exhibition\,art
END:VEVENT
