DTSTAMP:20260920T105600Z
DTSTART:20260924T133000Z
DTEND:20260924T153000Z
SUMMARY:Cilappatikaram / The Anklet's Verdict
LOCATION:The Stein Auditorium\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New D
 elhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1420
DESCRIPTION:IHC Theatre Festival 2026 . Cilappatikaram / The Anklet's Ver
 dict (Tamil/105 mins) An adaptation in Kutiyattam. Written by Ilango Adig
 al. Conceived & Directed by Sooraj Nambiar . Cast. Sooraj Nambiar\, Kapil
 a Venu\, Sankar Venkateswaran\, Tharun Bharath & others. A powerful reima
 gining of the ancient Tamil epic Cilappatikaram through the expressive vo
 cabulary of Kutiyattam\, the world's oldest living Sanskrit theatre tradi
 tion. This production brings to life the journey of its female protagonis
 t\, Kannaki\, from love and loss to divine justice through a deeply expre
 ssive and meditative performance. Rooted in Kutiyattam's canonical tradit
 ions and rare in its convergence of Tamil and Sanskrit legacies—this pr
 oduction is an immersive encounter with myth\, memory\, and theatre's end
 uring essence. Prod. TRIPUDI Ensemble . Tickets at Rs.200\, Rs.350 & Rs.5
 00 are available on bookmyshow.com and at the Habitat Programmes desk. La
 te entry is strictly prohibited .\n\nhttps://indiahabitat.org/Events_deta
 ils/1420
CATEGORIES:performance\,theatre
END:VEVENT
