SUMMARY:Hindi Medium Tight
LOCATION:The Theatre\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New Delhi 1100
 03
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1439
DESCRIPTION:IHC Theatre Festival 2026 . Hindi Medium Tight (Hindi/80 mins
 ) Based on ‘Hindi Medium Tight’ by Prabhat Ranjan . Adapted and Perfo
 rmed by Himanshu Tyagi . Design & Direction by Bijesh Jayarajan . Produce
 d by Shalini Vatsa . A solo performance\, set in Delhi University’s Hin
 du College in the early 90s\, it explores the world of “Hindiwallahs”
 - students navigating the divide between Hindi and English\, where langua
 ge becomes a marker of class\, confidence and belonging. Through humour\,
  poetry and sharp satirical self-criticism\, the performance examines the
  insecurities\, friendships and social hierarchies shaped by language\, w
 hile celebrating the courage to laugh\, push back and find one’s own vo
 ice. Presented by You and Me Productions . Entry by Registration. Late en
 try is strictly prohibited .\n\nhttps://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1
 439
CATEGORIES:performance\,theatre
END:VEVENT
